 help of  gazelles knights providing them with air  support fight secrets ensues and all of  the side characters work together to  kill the megalodons leaving just  corruptus as the last remaining threat  even after rimaru joins the fight and  everybody uses their strongest attacks  they only deal 30 percent damage to  kryptus  rimeru uses his appraisal skill to learn  more about it and he finds that it  possesses  an intense hate for moline he decides  it's kind of her business at that point  so he allows her to join the fight she  holds back her power just enough to one  shot corruptus while also managing to  keep phobia alive in the process  aura is removed from phobia and absorbed  by rimaru when he regains consciousness  he apologizes for the trouble and  explains that he was helped by footman  and tear  they label them along with laplace as  members of the moderate harlequin  alliance  ramiro of course decides to forgive  phobia for his actions and then they  meet with his master in carrion who is  eavesdropping nearby  carrion reprimands phobia by smashing  his face into the ground  and agrees to enter a non-aggression  pact with the tempest nation as an  apology  episode 20. things have calmed down a  bit after the fight and malim decides to  go back to work as one of the demon  lords  later that night rumuru has a dream of  shizu pleading to save the children he  thinks that this could be one of her  regrets so he decides to go to the  kingdom of igracia where shizu used to  teach  him and ranga head to ingrassia to find  the school freedom academy which was  established by one of shizu's students  arriving at the free union headquarters  he goes to meet with the grand master  he is greeted by shizu's old student  yuki kagurazaka who at first isn't too  happy to see him wearing shizu's mask  they almost get into a fight but rimrou  convinces him that he is from japan like  yuki  and the two of them hit it off talking  about manga and anime  after explaining that shuzu's regret was  leaving behind her students yuki is able  to have rimaru take over  shizu's class to teach in her stead yuki  also explains that the five children are  summoned and when they are summoned as  children they are given power to fulfill  a certain role  it's possible that their tiny bodies  can't take the massive fluctuation of  energy and abilities which will cause  their bodies to be incinerated  any person summoned to the world under  10 years old has died within five years  of being there  whole nations are involved in these  summonings because it's easier to just  summon a hero instead of building armies  to fight monsters  rimrou vows to find a way to save them  and we meet the five kids  there is kenya misaki age 10 ryota  sekiguchi age  10 gail gibson age 11. ellis rondo age 9  and finally chloe auburn age 10. episode  21  the kids are a little unruly so rimaru  uses ranga to keep them in check and  then they have one-on-one duels  he's hoping that the fights will burn up  their excess magicals and save their  lives  all of them have unique powers and take  turns trying to defeat rimaru but  ultimately fail  afterwards he found that the magic kills  weren't affected by the fight so it was  a total waste of time it then shows the  kids shizu's mask and says that he vows  to save them in her memory so they all  start to trust and respect him a little  bit more  vesta had taught him to use a work  portal so he uses that to go meet with  trainee his next hunch is that if they  can get superior spirits to inhabit the  kids like ifrit did to shizu that might  allow them to control their energy  he has training where they can fight  superior spirits and she suggests the  dwelling of spirits which is ruled by  the queen of spirits  the only problem is that trainee isn't  sure how to get into the dwelling of  spirits because the entrance she once  used had vanished  jump ahead one month and while out  training with the kids a  skydragon shows up and terrorizes  ingrassia reimaru goes to defeat the  dragon and after his display of power he  is invited to dinner by a merchant named  meal meyer  the dinner is just to repay rimaru for  saving the merchant's life from the  skydragon once they get to talking  though rimaru suggests having the  merchant come back to his town since  they want to start selling things but  aren't sure where to start there also  just so happened to be a thick blonde at  the party who knew about the dwelling of  spirits and where it's at rimaru gives  her a fat tip for the information and  they find out the location  now he has a new destination the old  nature park in the northern part of a  frontier nation called the republic of  ograssia  episode 22. ramiroo takes the kids there  and they go through the entrance ending  up in a labyrinth they hear a voice that  tasks them with destroying a robot  before they can meet with the spirits  looks intimidating but rainbow is able  to one shot it with his fire  they are then greeted by the small fairy  and great demon lord romarese of the  labyrinth  after they get to talking we learned  that she had built her golem using  spirit engineering which is similar to  what vesta had [ __ ] up and blamed on  kaijin she actually got the gollum's  parts from vesta's failed project  but anyways rimrou makes the request  that she takes them to the queen of  spirits to save the kids  turns out romarese is actually the queen  of spirits but fell from grace and  became a demon lord we also learned that  leon was once a hero and he had fallen  from grace also  he did this with the goal of summoning  somebody specific from another world we  also recall that traney had said that  she had no connections with the current  queen of spirits  what she doesn't know is that the  current queen had been reincarnated  with the memories of her past lives  which is when she knew training  that aside romerese takes them to the  deepest part of the labyrinth which is  where the dwelling of spirits is  although the spirits might not answer  them rommery suggests seifening off some  of their energy and creating a new  spirit  episode 23. gail is the first one to go  and he calls upon the spirits  no greater spirits show up but a number  of lesser spirits do reroute uses his  gluttony skill to absorb and unify the  spirits making a new superior  one the spirit has the earth attribute  and he combines it with gail allowing  him to keep his magicals in check saving  him from his imminent death  they repeat the process with alice  making a new superior spirit with the  space attribute when it's kenya's turn a  pure light spirit shows up and offers to  take care of him until he's grown up so  he merges with that spirit rio gets  another artificial spirit with water and  wind attributes  and the last one is chloe but before  they can complete the process  a woman's spirit shows up and interrupts  them rommery starts to panic  saying that the spirit is dangerous and  without saying anything she merges with  chloe  even though this wasn't exactly part of  the plan she still seems to be okay  romares goes on to explain that the  spirit is from the future and by  choosing chloe it's laid the foundation  for its own rebirth they can't really do  anything now because it already merged  with her upside is that chloe is safe  from her imminent death also so they're  just going to back burner that for now  as payment for ron maurice's help rimaru  gives her a new golem to replace the one  that he had destroyed  it's just a shell though so he summons a  demon to possess it and give it life we  then get a fast cryptic shot of some guy  spying on rimaru  in the last couple of scenes we also see  that he had left shizu's mask with chloe  saying it felt like the natural thing to  do  episode 24. we now jump into the past to  follow one of shizu's stories  a dying woman summons a demon to get  revenge for her partner's death before  dying herself  shizu is summoned to the kingdom of  filtwood along with other adventurers to  deal with the demon's resurrection they  believe that the demon's objective is to  recover its body from when it was alive  which is kept beneath the castle  shizu points out that since the demon  was able to defeat the champions the two  silver wings  it might be an arc demon one of the  guards then kills one of the adventurers  revealing that there was a lesser demon  residing inside of him they go on to say  that any adventurer that isn't willing  to work with them  is likely possessed by a demon and will  also be killed the demon from before  that made the contract with the dying  woman makes his presence known posing as  one of the adventurers and going by the  nickname black  he goes on to explain that the guards  were the ones that summoned the lesser  demons  jesus steps in to confront him and he  admits that he plans on killing  everybody in the room in order to get to  the demon that he's been tasked with  killing  this prompts a fight between the two and  shizu releases a powerful attack that  reveals him to be a demon also when he  lands a blow on her mask  it deflects it and he comes to the  conclusion that her mask suppresses time  this is enough to deter his attack and  forces his retreat shizu recalls how  leon told her about the most powerful  demons called progenitors and instead of  names they're referred to by colors  anyway she is then summoned by one of  the knights to meet with the king  and he ends up taking her beneath the  castle turns out the king and minister  are working for the demon she was hired  to defeat  he has taken on the persona of orthos  which was the hero who had defeated him  before he was brought back to life  since he had acquired a name he became  an arc demon aka a greater demon general  and plans to kill shizu now that she  isn't at full strength  ultimately he wants to absorb her power  and take control of her mask so they get  into a fight shizu is too weak to fight  and thinks about letting efreet free to  fight in her stead but then black makes  his reappearance  he goes on to kill the king and minister  it's also revealed that he was hired by  the champions the two silver wings after  they were defeated by orthos  orthos has his soul destroyed by black  to prevent his reincarnation which also  purges all of the demons in the kingdom  afterwards the story is told that the  demon black had killed the king and  minister but was then defeated by shizu  black is very much alive though and was  also the one that was spying on rimaru  in the last couple of scenes there is  some foreshadowing saying that black  will be summoned by rimaru and receive  the new name of diablo  i'm going to be doing the future seasons  and you can find that on the left side  whenever i'm finished with it or you can  check out all the that time i got  reincarnated as a slime recaps in the  playlist on the right side you can also  find the links in the description below  and the only thing i hate more than  intros is outros
 

